Package: libnotify4
Version: @DEB_LIBNOTIFY_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libnotify
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0
Description: Desktop notification client library
 libnotify sends desktop notifications to a org.freedesktop.Notifications daemon
 (provided at runtime by gnome-shell). Built for rootless iOS; used by
 gnome-settings-daemon and GNOME apps.
